    "Registers four reviewed purchase modules, shared persistent Core journal, protected receipt events and UI sole purchase writer.",
    "Demand requires current local active Baiqi, current owned visible safe possible park tile and no live owned naturalist. Consumed delayed-death ghosts ignored; unknown stock fails closed.",
